{"title":"Secrets of AoPS","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Welcome to the Secrets of AoPS.\n</p><p>I intend to document interesting things here, although it might not necessarily be secrets.\n</p><p>Admins, feel free to change the name. I probably will.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Sealsrock\" title=\"User:Sealsrock\">Sealsrock</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:Sealsrock\" title=\"User talk:Sealsrock\">talk</a>) 01:00, 17 December 2020 (EST)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20170:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110113 and revision id 139851. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}